{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Patchd 能把任何相片或影片化成實驗藝術，適合創作人、VJ、音樂人與設計師使用。你可以用逾 100 款圖層組出專屬相機特效，或直接以文字描述讓 AI 生成效果，再剪輯並匯出成適合直向影片的成品。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-163.webp\">\n<h2>百款圖層自組相機特效</h2>\n<p>以 FX Maker 將 glitch、色彩、馬賽克、扭曲、人臉與物件等逾 100 款圖層疊成專屬相機特效，圖層可放在人物、背景或整個畫面，並調整混合與透明度，再以表情或手勢即時驅動。隨機堆疊後可微調並儲存，成品會存入 My FXs，登入後同步至帳戶。另備節拍同步範本的時間軸剪輯、Re-Patch 重新渲染，以及 90 多款即時相機小工具。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-295-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-296-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-297-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-298-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-299-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-300-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Patchd: Video FX Playground</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:00:13.244237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T03:17:40.701423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:45.072850+00:00","content_hash":"ec9660c55c2d814a1e3581cf67c1c0e68c281696206da12231600aafe6659389","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}